                                "example_id": "8251d6a3-8144-4d54-87aa-9f7a305bdc89",
                                "sense_id": "69b1462d-f296-3e44-9eb0-568f0cf0910a",
                                "text": "They go out also to spend the night there on the night if mid-Sha'ban, and the market people take out all kinds of eatables."
